y": "こんにちは。\n\nあなたのアートワークが本当に大好きです。私の新しいOCであるタロスの絵を依頼したいのですが。\n\nタロスはティールグリーンの髪をした人間と人工知能のハイブリッドで、身長は176cmです。\n\nVtubersの伝説では、彼はかつて人間だったが、重傷を負っているところを発見され、彼の命を救うためにVtubersの宇宙海賊船から人工知能が彼の体に移された。これが人工知能と同化した最終形態である。\n\n性格はいたって真面目で、ストイック。\n\n近未来的なハイテクな環境・雰囲気の中で描かせたいと思っています。\n\n正確なポーズはお任せしますが、画像のどこかに彼の慣れ親しんだ鳥が入るようにお願いします。\n\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-6_UaLtkNA_suwioIK-0kHOQfv8vfBOM?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@GameYaruZaurus/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1281453, "client_id": 889500, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3698b1e8/uploads/origins/32ac984a-a6dc-4d9d-aae0-6f67e2bc2e7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbb42a5215216cc00c2c05396f263351", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3698b1e8/uploads/origins/32ac984a-a6dc-4d9d-aae0-6f67e2bc2e7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cbb42a5215216cc00c2c05396f263351, https://si.imgix.net/3698b1e8/uploads/origins/32ac984a-a6dc-4d9d-aae0-6f67e2bc2e7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c67f8dfa2969f540033a8668ccd86c2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3698b1e8/uploads/origins/32ac984a-a6dc-4d9d-aae0-6f67e2bc2e7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=965dfaa891c6d8d96e8e1c2d5db33515 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3698b1e8/uploads/origins/32ac984a-a6dc-4d9d-aae0-6f67e2bc2e7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27fcd82fcd369230e1247e8927bb14ea", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3698b1e8/uploads/origins/32ac984a-a6dc-4d9d-aae0-6f67e2bc2e7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27fcd82fcd369230e1247e8927bb14ea, https://si.imgix.net/3698b1e8/uploads/origins/32ac984a-a6dc-4d9d-aae0-6f67e2bc2e7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=10899860c46c5df71a20aa12bcd2f584 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3698b1e8/uploads/origins/32ac984a-a6dc-4d9d-aae0-6f67e2bc2e7b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=81185bdb18ef885776f22d689a1f4e7b 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは ! I love your artstyle and I would like to support you by ordering a commission !\n\nI would love you to draw my character/persona. Yukito is an alien catboy (he loves anything related to space and note that he always has soft expressions, see reference)\n\n- I would like Fire to be part of it (they are very close) and he has long hair with 2 rings on a necklace around his neck.\n-Could you make it so they are in a slightly dynamic angle, each character and expressions visible. Each character also on separate layers (and from background) for PNG and thumbnail ?\n-I would like them to look cool and ready to fight holding their respective guns. (picture can be WAIST UP)\n- Can you please design them your own VALORANT themed outfits referenced from their original \"Vtuber\" outfits so it can fit the vibe ? I leave the liberty of designs to you.\n\nReferences : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1W1F8EXF2jMeSrgLcp6ZQRGYp-nnsJ3qd?usp=sharing\n\nThank you if you end up taking my order !", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@GameYaruZaurus/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1281453, "client_id": 384676, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fbb7b44c/uploads/origins/c2844474-292c-46d6-96e8-6946ddb72896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d95cc1b2187710644865c8ea7d3cca02", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.n